							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 3px;" class="signature">&quot;remember the plight of the lucky charms Leprechaun; He&#039;s always chasing the pot of gold, but when he gets there, at the end of the day, it&#039;s just corn flakes.&quot;<br /><br />- Christopher Walken (CLICK)</div>
