							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">yeah I remember that one<br />and I had that in mind when I started this post, because it&#039;s not the genre that I&#039;m concerned with, so much as how much sensitivity towards the Gansta image can sometimes make us forget about the fruits that come out of the music<br />in most of the Gangsta rap I listen to, theres an underlying message about downside to being a gangster and the harsh reality of living that life<br />like ok I&#039;m popin glocks and servin rocks, but I&#039;m also being shot at by the cops and getting stabbed in the back by my closest friends and facing sins when I look in the miror<br />and that might not be what every song from a particular artist is like, but at least it&#039;s not like all of their stuff is just about livin it up cocaine kingdom<br /><br />here&#039;s three random Ghetto boys videos:<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/rL9ihXiFAko"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/rL9ihXiFAko" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/LY4E1xwgEM4"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/LY4E1xwgEM4" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/bbNHzF1Xzyc"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/bbNHzF1Xzyc" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object></div>
